{"id": "EUVD-2026-38127", "enisaUuid": "4184866e-2566-350b-ac50-2e08954b6c6a", "description": "Capgo before 12.128.2 contains an open redirect vulnerability in the confirm-signup endpoint that allows attackers to redirect users to arbitrary external websites. The confirmation_url parameter is not validated, enabling attackers to craft malicious links for phishing and credential harvesting attacks.", "datePublished": "2026-06-20T15:24:49", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-08T15:51:28", "baseScore": 5.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:A/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:L/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/Cap-go/capgo/security/advisories/GHSA-24q8-ghqq-m8cj", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/capgo-open-redirect-via-confirmation-url-parameter"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-56332", "GHSA-8pv8-j6gq-48m4"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.22, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "badd9071-70a9-3932-8f55-23026e5ed581", "product": {"name": "capgo", "vendor": {"name": "Cap-go"}}, "product_version": "0 <12.128.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "395ed33b-3e82-36a8-b389-f334b8987f6b", "vendor": {"name": "Capgo"}}], "isExploited": false}